{"id":"steam-1065860","steam":1065860,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"The Heist","summary":"The Heist is a cyberpunk interactive comic with puzzle elements in which you can influence how the story unfolds and finishes. Featuring multiple possible endings, print out your own gameplay of the story and keep it as a hard copy.","about":"Welcome to The Heist, where the odds are definitely not in your favor, and even the smallest mistake could prove to be fatal.\r\n\r\nThe Heist follows four protagonists in their attempt to steal a technological prototype from a high-security research facility on Ganymede.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nGAMEPLAY\n\r\n\r\nDifficult Decisions and Multiple Endings – In this interactive comic with puzzle elements, the player will have to make difficult decisions and each of them will have a ripple effect on the outcome of the story. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBased on the decisions made, there are multiple possible endings, which gives the game substantial and varied replay value. Upon finishing the game, the player has an option to print it out in the form of a comic book. \r\n\r\n\nART AND MUSIC\n\r\n\r\nCombining cyberpunk, film noir, and a captivating soundtrack, The Heist is a tense thriller that will get you hooked from the start.\r\n\r\n\nSTORY BEATS\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n• Glamorous Ganymede - Ganymede is situated in the richest and most orderly sector of the Sol Invictus universe, in which the whole Solar System is colonized, but there is trouble brewing beneath its perfect façade. \r\n• Exclusive Gala – Wealthy politicians and owners of rich corporations spend their free time oblivious to the troubles of the poor. To relieve themselves of existential boredom, they throw excessive parties and organize costly balls.\r\n• Yusein-Takeda Corporation - Our protagonists are trying to steal a technological prototype from a research facility that belongs to the Yusein-Takeda corporation, one of the most influential corporations in the System. \r\n• Cyberspace – There are two types of reality in the universe of Sol Invictus: the physical reality and cyberspace. The dangers are very real and very deadly in both of them.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/library_600x900.jpg?t=1644301859","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/header.jpg?t=1644301859","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/library_hero.jpg?t=1644301859","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/header.jpg?t=1644301859","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1644301859","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_e57c0c4dcbb748e21fc8733a16293583fee4b49f.600x338.jpg?t=1644301859","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_e57c0c4dcbb748e21fc8733a16293583fee4b49f.jpg?t=1644301859"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_3e1e25d4e79e9842a7ddbde8bb6d58261bf83b5a.600x338.jpg?t=1644301859","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_3e1e25d4e79e9842a7ddbde8bb6d58261bf83b5a.jpg?t=1644301859"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_3c523013c555ae136cca0e3959d06a4dc5dead8e.600x338.jpg?t=1644301859","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_3c523013c555ae136cca0e3959d06a4dc5dead8e.jpg?t=1644301859"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_178d1be6e5ed36bbf716ea3c361a5c9e23fd680c.600x338.jpg?t=1644301859","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065860/ss_178d1be6e5ed36bbf716ea3c361a5c9e23fd680c.jpg?t=1644301859"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steams